### Pixel Patterns

`drive` and `dots` share one chevron wavefront on a 650ms cycle; `orbit` is a comet lapping the grid perimeter, and its centre cell never lights.

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="WorkingIndicatorVariantsDemo" code-lang="vue" title="Pixel patterns" description="How drive, dots, and orbit differ in wavefront and cell shape."}
